OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Three hundred metres in
OL,13,G     Montparnasse
OL,14,     FThe Paris area of Montparnasse has
OL,15,     Fbeen home to some of the most
OL,16,     Finfluential artists and writers of
OL,17,     Fthe last two centuries. Some of
OL,18,     Fthem lived on a street called Rue
OL,19,     FBoissonade.
