OL,5,G2000 The Briefing Room
OL,6,     FThe ceasefire between the
OL,7,     FSaudi-backed Yemen government and
OL,8,     Fthe Houthi rebels is over. As the
OL,9,     Ffighting for control of land and
OL,10,     Fsea intensifies, why does this
OL,11,     Fmatter to all of us?
OL,12,G2030 BBC Inside Science
OL,13,     FAlso, we celebrate human
OL,14,     Fachievements with this week's
OL,15,     FNobel prizes, we visit penguin
OL,16,     FMordor, and we remember space
OL,17,     Finnovator Margaret Hamilton.
